              "content": "bool\npop_visibility (int kind)\n{\n  if (!visstack.length ())\n    return false;\n  if ((visstack.last () >> 8) != kind)\n    return false;\n  default_visibility\n    = (enum symbol_visibility) (visstack.pop () & 0xff);\n  visibility_options.inpragma\n    = visstack.length () != 0;\n  return true;\n}"
